abstract: "Public materials from a NASA Earth Action Water Resources Program project on nitrate dynamics in Iowa streams and rivers, including hands-on workshop materials on agricultural remote sensing with cloud platforms and geospatial foundation models. This work was supported by the NASA Earth Action Water Resources Program (Grant number 80NSSC26K0798)."
